@page "/about"
<h1>About</h1>

<div>
    <h4>Site Creators</h4>
    <ul>
    <li>Franklin Wright</li>
    <li>Pranav Battini</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        This website was created by Franklin Wright and Pranav Battini from Zoda Chapter 02-1309. This site is made to provide students and teachers with easy tutorials over certain topics!
    </p>
    <p>It was written using ASP.NET and is hosted in Microsoft Azure.</p>

    <h5>SQL Database Integration</h5>
    <p>The website utilizes a SQL database to store and manage data efficiently. This includes information about classes, students, tutorials, and their progress.</p>

    <h5>Data Flow</h5>
    <p>When a user interacts with the website, the ASP.NET backend communicates with the SQL database to fetch and update information.</p>

    <h5>Microsoft Azure Hosting</h5>
    <p>The website is hosted on Microsoft Azure, a cloud computing platform. Azure provides a reliable and scalable infrastructure for hosting ASP.NET applications and SQL databases, ensuring optimal performance and availability.</p>


</div>

